      en: ["Located in the central highlands of the Sinai Peninsula", "Consists primarily of ancient igneous rock formations", "Features natural rock basins for rainwater collection", "Home to several rare species of desert medicinal herbs", "Traditional transit area for local Bedouin tribes", "Offers panoramic views stretching to the Tih Plateau"],
